以下代码意图捕获运行时错误，但有两处问题：① `catch` 顺序写反，② 按值捕获导致切片。请修复：

```cpp
try { throw std::runtime_error("x"); }
catch (std::exception e) { std::cout << e.what() << '\n'; }   // 问题①按值 ②基类在前
catch (std::runtime_error e) { std::cout << "rt\n"; }
```

answer.reference_code:
try { throw std::runtime_error("x"); }
catch (const std::runtime_error& e) { std::cout << "rt: " << e.what() << '\n'; }
catch (const std::exception& e)        { std::cout << "base: " << e.what() << '\n'; }

